  "bodyHash": "65388e2ea8122ec5",
  "content": "\n\n<h2>Universal Bushy Leaves</h2>\n<p>一款開箱即用、設定簡單的叢葉包。<br>\n這或許不是市面上技術最頂尖的葉片優化包，但它能穩穩達成目標，且已準備好直接用於任何整合包，或與您喜愛的資源包搭配！<br>\n只需微調原版與模組中（幾乎）所有葉片共用的單一模型，就無需擔心相容性問題，也不用怕材質看起來不協調。</p>\n<h3>模組相容性</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BqYw00D.gif\" alt=\"模組相容性展示\"><br>\n大多數模組預設即可相容，但在極少數情況下可能需要額外設定，例如 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-vinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Let's Do] Vinery</a>。<br>\n若您發現不相容的模組，歡迎加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a> 告知我！</p>\n<h3>資源包相容性</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/K2QW8EcS/images/f13c1dc468e177863fb5db4c14444c84a0cfd96e.gif\" alt=\"資源包相容性展示\"></p>\n<p>任何不更改葉片模型的資源包都能與此包相容，只需確保將其載入順序設在此包之下即可！<br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/K2QW8EcS/images/fc26f405cbc4746d9ca4151118ce7c1a792559d1.png\" alt=\"安裝順序示意圖\"></p>\n<h3>效能表現</h3>\n<p>為世界中的葉片新增額外方塊確實會對效能造成些許影響。<br>\n我已盡力將影響降至最低，並使其與同類包相當，但仍建議搭配使用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcull-less-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cull Less Leaves</a> 或類似模組，以便根據您的需求調整設定並維持流暢的幀率！</p>\n<h3>那是什麼葉子？</h3>\n<p>我也不太確定，但它應該是來自以下其中之一。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmellowed\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mellowed</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fovergrown-flowery-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modern Miznuo's</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fovergrown-flowery-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overgrown Flowery GUI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f51e0kYxF\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coming Soon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome's We've Gone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome's O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnatures-spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Spirit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftraverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-bloomingnature\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blooming Nature</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flets-do-vinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vinery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffaithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\">Faithful 64x</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fclayful-128x\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clayful</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fwhimscape\" rel=\"nofollow\">Whimscape</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmizunomcmemo.blogspot.com%252fp%252fmizunos-16-craft-cit.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizunos 16 Craft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ff8thful\" rel=\"nofollow\">f8thful</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fbsl-shaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSL</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fshader%252fcomplementary-unbound\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complimentary Unbound</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcoolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/coolbot100s/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fcollection%252f146032%252fall-garden-gals-content%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s/Bouncy-Leaves/assets/76798835/0b2c0293-c2ab-4956-9055-70bc7d7141c5\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/generic-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"支援我們\"></a></p>",
